I am on the street.
Suddenly, large drops fall.
Heavy rain starts.
Now it is raining heavily!
This is my first rain in Mumbai.
I look towards the sky.
I smile.
There is no heat at all now.
But I am getting wet.
There is a shop nearby.
I quickly go near the shop.
I stand under the shop's awning.
Many other people are standing there.
We all wait together.
After some time, the rain lightens.
I walk towards the bus stop.
My BEST bus arrives.
I get on the bus.
I go home comfortably.
